  "reason": "We've seen 10 residents reported to the clinic with stomach illnesses, and we need to take responsibility and ensure their health and safety."
}

{
  "public_post": "UPDATE: We are still awaiting further instructions from the co-op regarding the next steps after recalling all bread. Please wait for further guidance before disposing of any bread or making any further claims.",
